<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE- ATAG FIRST-HALF NET PROFIT FALLS.</title>
<headline>TABLE- ATAG FIRST-HALF NET PROFIT FALLS.</headline>
<dateline>ULFT, Netherlands 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30,</p>
<p>1997 (in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     2.28 vs   5.04</p>
<p>    Net profit			     5.8  vs  12.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Industrial holding company Atag Holding NV previously</p>
<p>said it did not expect 1997 results to recover until the second</p>
<p>half of the year.</p>
<p>    Turnover			    579.4   vs 495.2</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			8.6   vs  16.9</p>
<p>    Tax				     3.4   vs   5.1</p>
<p>    third party interests	     0.6   vs   0.7</p>
<p>-- Redactie Amsterdam +020 - 504 5000</p>
</text>
